# Override darklab_shell's application fine-tuning settings here. Settings you
# omit keep their shipped values. Other supported local content overrides use
# the same relative names under this deployment's conf/ directory.
#
# Built-in settings, defaults, and examples (reference only):
# https://gitlab.com/darklab.sh/darklab_shell/-/blob/v@RELEASE_VERSION@/app/conf/config.yaml
# Operator guide:
# https://gitlab.com/darklab.sh/darklab_shell/-/blob/v@RELEASE_VERSION@/CONFIGURATION.md
#
# Deployment wiring and optional feature switches live in ../.env. That includes
# WORKSPACE_*, DATABASE_BACKEND/DATABASE_URL, INTERACTIVE_PTY_ENABLED,
# RESTRICTED_COMMAND_INPUT_CIDRS, RAW_PACKET_SCANNING_ENABLED, PROMETHEUS_MULTIPROC_DIR,
# and the core AI provider and feature variables. Use this file for application
# fine-tuning such as Files limits, PTY limits, database pool/JIT settings, AI
# timeouts and queue limits, retention, notifications, and UI behavior.
#
# YAML settings use `key: value`, not `key = value`.
# Example - remove the leading # to use it:
# workspace_max_file_mb: 10
